<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - April 10.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - April 10.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement at the close of trade on Thursday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at the close was 3598.37, 52.51 points or 1.44 percent lower than Wednesday's close.</p>
<p>.</p>
